  "configuration_id": "config_010",
  "reason": "With only one completed experiment (config_001: rna_only/singleprofile/pca_n2000 at ~48.5% acc), the dominant uncertainty is whether the image modality carries any useful signal at all. Testing image_only with resnet50 and singleprofile (config_010) isolates this fundamental question with minimal confounds. If image alone performs competitively or better than RNA alone, it strongly motivates investing subsequent budget in multimodal fusion and profile/aggregation choices. If it performs poorly, it redirects the search toward RNA encoder and multiprofile improvements, avoiding wasted experiments on multimodal configs that would likely underperform. This is the highest-information single experiment available: it partitions the remaining 50 configs into two broad strategic directions and cannot be inferred from the RNA-only baseline."
}

